---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SiteHeader } from '../components/SiteHeader';
import SiteFooter from '../components/SiteFooter.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service | Simpsonville AC Repair"
  description="Terms of Service for Simpsonville AC Repair — a local HVAC lead generation and referral service in Simpsonville, SC."
  canonical="/terms-of-service/"
>
  <div class="page-root">
    <div class="topbar">
      <div class="tb-inner">
        <span>📍 Serving Simpsonville &amp; Greenville Areas</span>
        <span class="tb-div">|</span>
        <span>📞 <a href="tel:8647547291" style="color:#fff;font-weight:700">864-754-7291</a></span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <SiteHeader client:load />

    <div class="inner-hero">
      <div class="inner-hero-inner">
        <nav class="inner-hero-breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
          <a href="/">Home</a>
          <span> › </span>
          <span>Terms of Service</span>
        </nav>
        <h1 class="inner-h1">Terms of Service</h1>
        <p style="color:rgba(255,255,255,.8);font-size:0.9rem;margin-top:6px">Last updated: January 1, 2025</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="inner-body">
      <div style="max-width:820px;margin:0 auto;padding:48px 24px 64px">
        <main id="main-content">

          <div style="background:#fff5f5;border-left:4px solid #CC2229;border-radius:8px;padding:18px 22px;margin-bottom:36px">
            <p style="margin:0;color:#7a1a1a;line-height:1.75;font-size:0.95rem">
              <strong>Please read these Terms carefully.</strong> By using this website or submitting a service request, you agree to these Terms of Service. Simpsonville AC Repair is a lead generation and referral service — not a licensed HVAC contractor. We connect homeowners with independent, licensed HVAC contractors.
            </p>
          </div>

          <h2 style="font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:1.25rem;color:#0D2D6E;margin:0 0 12px">1. Nature of Service</h2>
          <p style="color:#444;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:24px">
            Simpsonville AC Repair ("Company," "we," "us," or "our") operates the website simpsonvilleacrepair.com as a local lead generation and referral service. We do not perform HVAC, plumbing, or electrical work ourselves. When you submit a service request through our website or call our phone number, we forward your information to one or more licensed, independent HVAC contractors in our network who may contact you to schedule service.
          </p>
          <p style="color:#444;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:24px">
            <strong>We are the referral source, not the service provider.</strong> The contractor who contacts you is an independent third party. Any contract for services is between you and that contractor, not between you and Simpsonville AC Repair.
          </p>

          <h2 style="font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:1.25rem;color:#0D2D6E;margin:0 0 12px">2. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
          <p style="color:#444;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:24px">
            By accessing this website or submitting a service request (by form or phone), you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service and our Privacy Policy. If you do not agree, please do not use this website or submit any request.
          </p>

          <h2 style="font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:1.25rem;color:#0D2D6E;margin:0 0 12px">3. Consent to Be Contacted</h2>
          <p style="color:#444;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:24px">
            By submitting a service request form or calling our number, you expressly consent to receive calls, texts (SMS), and emails from Simpsonville AC Repair and from licensed HVAC contractors in our network, using the contact information you provide. This consent is not a condition of purchase. Message and data rates may apply. You may opt out of SMS by replying STOP at any time.
          </p>

          <h2 style="font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:1.25rem;color:#0D2D6E;margin:0 0 12px">4. No Warranty on Contractor Work</h2>
          <p style="color:#444;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:24px">
            While we vet contractors in our network for licensing and insurance, we make no warranty, express or implied, regarding the quality, workmanship, timeliness, or outcome of any work performed by referred contractors. All warranties or guarantees related to the actual service work are the responsibility of the individual contractor who performs the work. We are not liable for any damages, injuries, or losses arising from services performed by contractors in our network.
          </p>

          <h2 style="font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:1.25rem;color:#0D2D6E;margin:0 0 12px">5. Accuracy of Information</h2>
          <p style="color:#444;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:24px">
            We strive to provide accurate information about HVAC services, pricing ranges, and service areas on this website. However, all pricing information is approximate and for reference only. Actual pricing is determined by the independent contractor at the time of service. Pricing, availability, and service area coverage may change without notice.
          </p>

          <h2 style="font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:1.25rem;color:#0D2D6E;margin:0 0 12px">6. Referral Compensation</h2>
          <p style="color:#444;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:24px">
            Simpsonville AC Repair may receive compensation from contractors in our network for qualified referrals. This compensation does not affect the price you pay for HVAC services — pricing is set entirely by the contractor.
          </p>

          <h2 style="font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:1.25rem;color:#0D2D6E;margin:0 0 12px">7. Intellectual Property</h2>
          <p style="color:#444;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:24px">
            All content on this website — including text, images, logos, and design — is the property of Simpsonville AC Repair and is protected by applicable copyright and trademark laws. You may not reproduce, distribute, or create derivative works from any content on this site without our express written permission.
          </p>

          <h2 style="font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:1.25rem;color:#0D2D6E;margin:0 0 12px">8. Limitation of Liability</h2>
          <p style="color:#444;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:24px">
            To the maximum extent permitted by law, Simpsonville AC Repair shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages, including lost profits or data, arising from your use of this website, reliance on information provided herein, or from services performed by referred contractors. Our total liability to you for any claim arising from use of this website shall not exceed $100.
          </p>

          <h2 style="font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:1.25rem;color:#0D2D6E;margin:0 0 12px">9. Governing Law</h2>
          <p style="color:#444;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:24px">
            These Terms are governed by the laws of the State of South Carolina, without regard to its conflict-of-law provisions. Any dispute arising under these Terms shall be resolved in the courts of Greenville County, South Carolina.
          </p>

          <h2 style="font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:1.25rem;color:#0D2D6E;margin:0 0 12px">10. Changes to Terms</h2>
          <p style="color:#444;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:24px">
            We reserve the right to update these Terms at any time. Changes are effective immediately upon posting. Continued use of the website after changes constitutes acceptance of the revised Terms.
          </p>

          <h2 style="font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:1.25rem;color:#0D2D6E;margin:0 0 12px">11. Contact</h2>
          <p style="color:#444;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:16px">Questions about these Terms? Contact us:</p>
          <div style="background:#f7f9fd;border:1.5px solid #d8e2f3;border-radius:10px;padding:20px;margin-bottom:32px">
            <div style="font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:1rem;color:#0D2D6E;margin-bottom:10px">Simpsonville AC Repair</div>
            <div style="color:#444;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:2">
              📞 <a href="tel:8647547291" style="color:#1A7AC4">864-754-7291</a><br />
              📍 Simpsonville, SC 29681<br />
              🌐 simpsonvilleacrepair.com
            </div>
          </div>

          <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap">
            <a href="/" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;background:#0D2D6E;color:#fff;font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;padding:10px 20px;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none">← Back to Home</a>
            <a href="/privacy-policy/" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;border:2px solid #0D2D6E;color:#0D2D6E;font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;padding:10px 20px;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none">Privacy Policy →</a>
          </div>

        </main>
      </div>
    </div>

    <SiteFooter />
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
